{"id":"e75f0ffb2de05e6480a1214ee718fde477cd2052","axis":"silent","repo":"TanStack/router","sha":"e75f0ffb2de05e6480a1214ee718fde477cd2052","parsed":{"files":[{"path":".changeset/router-devtools-static-styles.md","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,10 @@","+---","+'@tanstack/router-devtools-core': patch","+---","+","+The devtools no longer use goober. Their styles are now a static stylesheet adopted into the document or shadow root the devtools render in, instead of a `<style>` element in `<head>`. This means:","+","+- The devtools are styled on pages with a Content Security Policy that blocks inline `<style>` elements, without a nonce.","+- Devtools rendered inside a shadow root are styled without passing `shadowDOMTarget`.","+- The devtools no longer write to the shared `#_goober` style element.","+- Browsers without adoptable stylesheets (before Safari 16.4 and Firefox 101) show the devtools unstyled."],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/router/devtools.md","lines":["@@ -191,8 +191,8 @@ function App() {","   - Defaults to `bottom-left`.","   - The position of the TanStack Router logo to open and close the devtools panel."," - `shadowDOMTarget?: ShadowRoot`","-  - Specifies a Shadow DOM target for the devtools.","-  - By default, devtool styles are applied to the `<head>` tag of the main document (light DOM). When a `shadowDOMTarget` is provided, styles will be applied within this Shadow DOM instead.","+  - The shadow root to add the devtools styles to.","+  - By default, the styles are added to the shadow root the devtools render in, or to the document when they do not render in a shadow root."," - `containerElement?: string | any`","   - Use this to render the devtools inside a different type of container element for ally purposes.","   - Any string which corresponds to a valid intrinsic JSX element is allowed.","@@ -320,5 +320,5 @@ function App() {"," - `handleDragStart?: (e: any) => void`","   - Handles the opening and closing the devtools panel.","